# My First Website 🌐

This project is called **My First Website** — built as part of a hands-on
task in a [Kevin Powell](https://www.youtube.com/@KevinPowell) HTML & CSS course.

It helped me practice and understand the basics of:
- Writing clean HTML structure
- Styling with CSS (including layout, colors, spacing, and typography)
- Responsive design principles

---

### 📚 Learning Context

This is **not an original design**. It was created by following along with Kevin Powell’s course, which
taught the foundational skills needed to build websites from scratch.

I followed the lessons and wrote the code myself to practice what I learned.

---

### ✅ Skills I Practiced

- Semantic HTML
- CSS Flexbox & Grid
- Styling forms, text, and layout
- Mobile responsiveness
- Folder structure for web projects

